Documents --> Generation : trusted chunks
Generation --> Material : summaries and questions
Material --> Study : ready packages
Generation --> Study : grounded evaluation
Interfaces ..> Documents
Interfaces ..> Generation
Interfaces ..> Material
Interfaces ..> Study

